   "ocr": "Note 10.\t\nBusiness Segment, Revenue Information, Geographic Information and Concentration of Risk"
  },
  "WDC_2019_p88__paragraph_1": {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "bbox": [
    70.0,
    142.7,
    526.5,
    253.0
   ],
   "ocr": "The Company manufactures, markets, and sells data storage devices and solutions in the U.S. and in foreign countries \nthrough its sales personnel, dealers, distributors, retailers, and subsidiaries. Based upon the management structure under \nthe current operating model, the Company determined that the Company’s Chief Operating Decision Maker, its Chief \nExecutive Officer, evaluates performance of the Company and makes decisions regarding allocation of resources based on \ntotal Company results. As a result, the Company concluded it operates in one segment, data storage devices and solutions. The following table summarizes the Company’s revenue by end market product category, between Client Devices \n(mobile, desktop, gaming and digital video hard drives, SSDs, embedded products and wafers); Data Center Devices and \nSolutions (capacity and performance enterprise HDDs, enterprise SSDs, data center software and system solutions); and \nClient Solutions (removable products, hard drive content solutions and flash content solutions):"
  },
